From 1c311371903c2bc5c9378685ccdd2a9d634abb55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 02:30:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] Add oracle gear and stats setup and state 0.6 equipment

Scene setup kits (adapter 0.14.0, capability scene_setup_kits):
setup_set_loadout strips a character and equips the requested weapons,
crossbows and armour (quality, or a weapon's maker, model and level);
setup_set_stats sets stored stats by their state 0.4 keys. State 0.6
adds each character's equipment rows.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
